# Environment Variables — DevDocs AI

## Required for Local Development

# Supabase Configuration
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key-here

# System Prompt (Core IP — stored in team 1Password vault)
DEVDOCS_SYSTEM_PROMPT=your-system-prompt-here

## Optional — Leave empty for local dev

# Sentry Error Tracking (Staging + Production only)
SENTRY_DSN=

# PostHog Analytics (Production only)
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=

# Stripe Payments (Phase 4 only)
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

## Notes

- Never commit .env.local or .env.production to version control
- All secrets use Vercel encrypted environment variables in production
- DEVDOCS_SYSTEM_PROMPT is server-side only — never exposed to client bundle
- BYOK API keys are stored in browser localStorage only — never in env vars
